(MUNICIPAL CORPORATION — Tender CE/CIV/91/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: CONCRETE AND REINFORCEMENT) Tj T*
(- Plain and reinforced cement concrete works shall comply with IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
(- Grade of concrete for all RCC members shall be M30.) Tj T*
(- The nominal cover to reinforcement shall be 45 m.m..) Tj T*
(- Maximum free water-cement ratio shall be 0.45.) Tj T*
(- Cement content shall be not less than 320 kg/cu.m.) Tj T*
(- OPC 43 grade cement complying with IS 269:2015 shall be used.) Tj T*
(- Aggregates, both coarse and fine, shall comply with IS 383:2016. Fe 500D TMT reinforcement) Tj T*
(bars complying with IS 1786:1985 shall be used.) Tj T*
(- Mix proportioning of concrete shall be done as per IS 10262:2019.) Tj T*
(- Concrete shall be cured for not less than 10 days.) Tj T*
(- Mechanical needle vibrators shall be used for compaction of concrete.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — STRUCTURAL STEEL WORK) Tj T*
(- Structural steel plates and sections shall be E250 grade complying with IS 2062:2011. Steel) Tj T*
(work shall be painted with one coat of zinc chromate primer followed by two finishing coats of) Tj T*
(enamel.) Tj T*
(- Steel work shall be fabricated and erected in accordance with approved drawings.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(- All wiring work shall comply with IS 732:2019.) Tj T*
(- The earthing arrangement of the supply system is TN-S.) Tj T*
(- All wiring shall run concealed in rigid PVC conduit having 1.5 m.m. wall thickness.) Tj T*
(- Wires are to be single core, stranded copper conductor, FR PVC insulated, 450/750 V grade to) Tj T*
(IS 694:2010.) Tj T*
(- Copper conductors of 1.5 mm2 shall be used for lighting circuits and 4 mm2 for power) Tj T*
(circuits.) Tj T*
(- MCBs shall comply with IS/IEC 60898-1 and have a rated short-circuit capacity of 10 kA \(rms\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 5) Tj T*
